Generated by `defwork/itautcreplay.py`.  `Equation111` is `x = x ◇ ((y ◇ z) ◇ y)`, and the companion is
`x □ y = if m(Y,Y) = Y then m(X,X) else m(X,Y)`.  Its automorphism half is
`GuardAut_pyy_y_pxx_pxy_Equation111`, proved elsewhere; each cell below is one more law the
companion satisfies, written out one superposition step at a time because `grind` reaches
none of these on its own.
-/

